## Pre-review findings — an idle reviewer flagged likely defects in completed work; CONFIRM each against the spec and FIX it before you finish:
- core-engine-tree-miner: 1) tree.go Insert routes through ALL tokens (deep trie) instead of fixed-depth prefix + leaf bucket with similarity matching — the core Drain clustering is broken: two lines differing only in one token get separate groups; 2) no template generalization: when a new line matches an existing group, the template never updates positions to `<*>` as required ("templates only ever get more general"); 3) no wildcard routing for placeholder tokens like `<NUM>` — they should route to a special wildcard child, not create separate children; 4) tree.go Collect() iterates `n.children` (a map) so tie-breaking on equal counts is non-deterministic; 5) miner.go ReadLines swallows errors from r.Next() — any error breaks the loop and returns nil error instead of propagating real I/O errors; 6) templateHash is defined but never wired into LogGroup or diff logic
